       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     TUPDQA.
       AUTHOR.         CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   SEPTEMBER 2004.

      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D TUPDQA -- UPDATE PLANT STARTUP VALUES IN QA ENVIRONMENT.  *
      *D           REQUEST #2004-77306                             *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DQUOTEXT-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3801
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                     WITH DUPLICATES
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DQUOTEXT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS3800 OF MCFLCS3801.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  LINE-NO                      PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X VALUE SPACE.

       01  BASE                         PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.

       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.

       01  QUOTE-INST-TBL.
           05  QUOTE-INST
               OCCURS 5 TIMES           PIC X(72).

      *************************************************************
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      *************************************************************

       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTST   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTRQRL IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DQUOTEXT IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

       01  MPLTINFO-ARG                 PIC X(4).

      *************************************************************
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       0-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "TUPDQA" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN I-O MPLTINFO-O, DQUOTEXT-O.
           INITIALIZE QUOTE-INST-TBL.
           MOVE "QUOTE GENERATED FROM QUALITY ASSURANCE DATA"
                                   TO  QUOTE-INST(1).
           MOVE "      !!! DO NOT PROCESS !!!               "
                                   TO  QUOTE-INST(2).

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-O, DQUOTEXT-O.
           GOBACK.

       2-BLOWUP.
           MOVE  "TUPDQA"       TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 61-UPDATE-MPLTINFO.
           PERFORM 62-UPDATE-DQUOTEXT.

      **************************************************
      *            M P L T I N F O                     *
      **************************************************

       61-UPDATE-MPLTINFO.
      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   P   0 1                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "P 01" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "!! TEST DATA !!"    TO   MPLTINFO-PLT-NAME (35:15)
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = P 01"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   P   1 1                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "P 11" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "!!! TEST DATA - DO NOT PROCESS !!!"
                                         TO   MPLTINFO-DATA
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = P 11"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   P O P T                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "POPT" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "01"       TO MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-NO
                                  MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO
                                  MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO-2
                                  MPLTINFO-01-QUOTE-PRT-NO
                                  MPLTINFO-02-QUOTE-PRT-NO
                                  MPLTINFO-LP-QUOTE-PRT-NO
                                  MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-1
                                  MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-2
                                  MPLTINFO-RAWMAT-PRT-NO
                                  MPLTINFO-SHIP-REL-PRT-NO
                                  MPLTINFO-PO-SPECIAL
               MOVE "00"       TO MPLTINFO-CAP-ITEM-PRT
               MOVE "N"        TO MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-MPE-SPOOLED
                                  MPLTINFO-PO-HP-PRINTER-SW
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = POPT"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   S T 0 0                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "ST00" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "01"                 TO   MPLTINFO-STR-PRT
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = ST00"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   E D I                   *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "EDI " TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "N"                  TO   EDI-INSTAL
                                              EDI-SEND-BLKTS
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = EDI"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   S T S T                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "STST" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "N"                  TO   MPLT-PRINT-SINGLE-ISS
                                              MPLT-PRINT-MULT-ISS
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = STST"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   R Q R L                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "RQRL" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "NOPRT"      TO REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = RQRL"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES       TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "RQRL"       TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "NOPRT"      TO REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-WRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "WRITE ERROR; KEY = RQRL"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   Q T A 1                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "QTA1" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "!!! TEST DATA ONLY !!!"
                                         TO  MPLTINFO-DATA (38:22)
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = QTA1"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            K E Y   =   Q T A 2                 *
      **************************************************
           MOVE "QTA2" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE "!!! DO NOT PROCESS !!!"
                                         TO  MPLTINFO-DATA (38:22)
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE ERROR; KEY = QTA2"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      **************************************************
      *            D Q U O T E X T                     *
      **************************************************

       62-UPDATE-DQUOTEXT.
           MOVE "STAND" TO QUOTENUM OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           MOVE ZEROS   TO ITEMNO   OF DQUOTEXT-O-REC.
           START DQUOTEXT-O KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               READ DQUOTEXT-O NEXT INTO BUF-DQUOTEXT
                   AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-READ
               PERFORM UNTIL DQUOTEXT-QUOTE-NO NOT = "STAND"
                   IF DQUOTEXT-ITM-NO = "0000"
                       DELETE DQUOTEXT-O
                   END-IF
                   READ DQUOTEXT-O NEXT INTO BUF-DQUOTEXT
                       AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                   END-READ
               END-PERFORM
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "START ERROR IN 62-UPDATE-DQUOTEXT" TO
                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
           PERFORM 620-REPLACE-DQUOTEXT VARYING LINE-NO FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL LINE-NO > 5.

       620-REPLACE-DQUOTEXT.
           MOVE "STAND" TO DQUOTEXT-QUOTE-NO.
           MOVE "0000"  TO DQUOTEXT-ITM-NO.
           MOVE LINE-NO TO DQUOTEXT-LINE-NO.
           MOVE QUOTE-INST (LINE-NO) TO DQUOTEXT-DATA.
           WRITE DQUOTEXT-O-REC FROM BUF-DQUOTEXT
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "PUT DQUOTEXT ERROR IN 620-R-D"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

